            <ArticleTitle>[Analgetics, co-analgetics and opioid-analgetics in the elderly].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>616-22; quiz 623</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1055/s-0028-1090024</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>There is a continuous increase in the proportion of elderly patients. Therefore physicians should be aware of specifics according to pain therapy in the elderly. This review will concentrate on selected topics related to pain therapy in the elderly patient. Furthermore specific consequences according to drug therapy are shown.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
